d:T35725,<p>这份笔记整理 <strong>359 篇主会论文</strong>：CVPR 2026 共 110 篇，ACL 2026 共 249 篇，覆盖工具调用、多模态、搜索、GUI/Web、代码与具身执行。</p>
<p>每篇用三句话记录 <strong>Idea、Research Problem、Insight</strong>，标题链接到官方论文页。需要按会议、方向和相关程度筛选时，可以打开<a href="https://boran002.github.io/agent-tool-use-2026/">交互式文献表</a>；<a href="https://github.com/BORAN002/agent-tool-use-2026">GitHub 笔记仓库</a>保留 Markdown 和<a href="https://boran002.github.io/agent-tool-use-2026/agent-tool-use-2026.json">结构化数据</a>。</p>
<p>仅收录 CVPR Main 与 ACL Long / Short，排除 Findings、Workshop、Industry 和 Demo。172 篇标为直接工具使用，187 篇为相关的执行、规划、记忆、安全和评测研究。以下分类用于阅读导航，方向之间存在交叉。</p>
<blockquote>
<p>检索日期：2026-10-24。概括依据官方摘要，Insight 为分析性提炼，不是作者原话；这份清单不保证零遗漏，也不代表已独立复现论文结论。正式录用来源为 <a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/CVPR2026?day=all">CVF</a> 和 <a href="https://aclanthology.org/events/acl-2026/">ACL Anthology</a>。</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 id="01-工具调用-训练-评测">01 · 工具调用 / 训练 / 评测</h2>
<p>64 篇 · CVPR 8 · ACL 56</p>
<h4 id="epiagent-an-agent-centric-system-for-ancient-inscription-restoration"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Zhu_EpiAgent_An_Agent-Centric_System_for_Ancient_Inscription_Restoration_CVPR_2026_paper.html">EpiAgent: An Agent-Centric System for Ancient Inscription Restoration</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · Main · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**让中央规划器协调碑文分析、历史经验和专业修复工具。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**固定修复流水线难适应复杂异质损坏。</li>
<li>**Insight：**专家式观察与再评估可指导自适应工具修复。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="from-intuition-to-investigation-a-tool-augmented-reasoning-mllm-framework-for-generalizable-face-anti-spoofing"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Zhang_From_Intuition_to_Investigation_A_Tool-Augmented_Reasoning_MLLM_Framework_for_CVPR_2026_paper.html">From Intuition to Investigation: A Tool-Augmented Reasoning MLLM Framework for Generalizable Face Anti-Spoofing</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · Main · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**用视觉工具检查细微伪造线索并训练工具感知检测策略。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**简短语义描述难捕获人脸伪造的细粒度证据。</li>
<li>**Insight：**主动调查工具能补足直觉式视觉判断。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="ipr-1-interactive-physical-reasoner"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Zhang_IPR-1_Interactive_Physical_Reasoner_CVPR_2026_paper.html">IPR-1: Interactive Physical Reasoner</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · Main · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**用物理动作代码统一推理和世界模型预测。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**视觉模型缺前瞻，世界模型易只模仿外观。</li>
<li>**Insight：**物理中心的动作表示能连接语义意图与环境动力学。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="scaling-agentic-reinforcement-learning-for-tool-integrated-reasoning-in-vlms"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Lu_Scaling_Agentic_Reinforcement_Learning_for_Tool-Integrated_Reasoning_in_VLMs_CVPR_2026_paper.html">Scaling Agentic Reinforcement Learning for Tool-Integrated Reasoning in VLMs</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · Main · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**构建统一视觉工具接口与可验证环境以扩展多轮强化学习。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**视觉工具选择、调用和协作缺少规模化训练基础设施。</li>
<li>**Insight：**多任务交互环境是释放视觉 Agent 能力的重要条件。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="training-one-model-to-master-cross-level-agentic-actions-via-reinforcement-learning"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/He_Training_One_Model_to_Master_Cross-Level_Agentic_Actions_via_Reinforcement_CVPR_2026_paper.html">Training One Model to Master Cross-Level Agentic Actions via Reinforcement Learning</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · Main · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**统一训练跨层级动作并按情境切换高低层接口。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**固定 API、GUI 或控制动作空间限制灵活性。</li>
<li>**Insight：**动作粒度应由效率和精度需求动态决定。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="drama-next-gen-dynamic-orchestration-for-resilient-multi-agent-ecosystems-in-flux"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Zhao_DRAMA_Next-Gen_Dynamic_Orchestration_for_Resilient_Multi-Agent_Ecosystems_in_Flux_CVPR_2026_paper.html">DRAMA: Next-Gen Dynamic Orchestration for Resilient Multi-Agent Ecosystems in Flux</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · Main · 扩展相关</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**以动态调度、任务接管和共享空间信息组织具身协作。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**固定分工难应对 Agent 上下线和环境变化。</li>
<li>**Insight：**运行时重分配与故障恢复应成为协作架构的核心。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="gtr-turbo-merged-checkpoint-is-secretly-a-free-teacher-for-agentic-vlm-training"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Wei_GTR-Turbo_Merged_Checkpoint_is_Secretly_a_Free_Teacher_for_Agentic_CVPR_2026_paper.html">GTR-Turbo: Merged Checkpoint is Secretly a Free Teacher for Agentic VLM Training</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · Main · 扩展相关</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**合并训练过程中的模型检查点作为免费的指导教师。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**逐步指导的 Agent RL 依赖昂贵外部模型。</li>
<li>**Insight：**训练自身产生的检查点可提供稳定且多样的监督。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="vs-bench-evaluating-vlms-for-strategic-abilities-in-multi-agent-environments"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Xu_VS-Bench_Evaluating_VLMs_for_Strategic_Abilities_in_Multi-Agent_Environments_CVPR_2026_paper.html">VS-Bench: Evaluating VLMs for Strategic Abilities in Multi-Agent Environments</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · Main · 扩展相关</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**在视觉多 Agent 环境中分开评测感知、策略推理和实际收益。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**单 Agent 或纯文本基准难衡量交互战略能力。</li>
<li>**Insight：**看懂场景与选出有效行动之间仍有明显差距。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="a-multi-agent-framework-for-high-interaction-terminal-simulation"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.1515/">A Multi-Agent Framework for High-Interaction Terminal Simulation</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · Long · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**将命令路由到真实工具或模拟 Agent 并维护一致文件状态。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**终端模拟易误解命令、格式漂移和状态失真。</li>
<li>**Insight：**混合执行与显式状态管理能提高多轮模拟真实性。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="agentgl-towards-agentic-graph-learning-with-llms-via-reinforcement-learning"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.1161/">AgentGL: Towards Agentic Graph Learning with LLMs via Reinforcement Learning</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · Long · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**通过图原生探索工具与课程强化学习进行图学习。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**文本式检索忽略真实数据的拓扑依赖。</li>
<li>**Insight：**图结构应参与 Agent 的主动探索，而不仅作为待阅读文本。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="architect-uncertainty-aware-dynamic-tool-learning-via-causal-intervention-for-open-world-agents"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.1707/">ARCHITECT: Uncertainty-Aware Dynamic Tool Learning via Causal Intervention for Open-World Agents</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · Long · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**以因果模型和沙箱干预诊断动态生成工具的失败原因。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**工具首调用失败难靠黑箱置信度准确修复。</li>
<li>**Insight：**代码可被干预的特性使工具可靠性能够进行因果归因。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="at²po-agentic-turn-based-policy-optimization-via-tree-search"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.1106/">AT²PO: Agentic Turn-based Policy Optimization via Tree Search</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · Long · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**用轮级搜索树联合优化探索、奖励传播和策略更新。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**多轮工具学习同时面临探索不足和粗粒度归因。</li>
<li>**Insight：**训练单位应与 Agent 的实际交互轮次对齐。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="autoreproduce-automatic-ai-experiment-reproduction-with-paper-lineage"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.1001/">AutoReproduce: Automatic AI Experiment Reproduction with Paper Lineage</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · Long · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**沿论文引用谱系补全隐含知识，并用多 Agent 实现代码复现和采样式单元测试。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**论文缺少实现细节与背景知识，使自动复现容易产生不可执行或偏离方法的代码。</li>
<li>**Insight：**引用关系提供的技术背景与执行验证结合，能改善复现的完整性。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="beyond-accuracy-unveiling-inefficiency-patterns-in-tool-integrated-reasoning"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.339/">Beyond Accuracy: Unveiling Inefficiency Patterns in Tool-Integrated Reasoning</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · Long · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**提出计入 KV-cache 重建与工具长回复的 PTE 效率指标。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**token 数和调用次数无法准确反映工具推理计算成本。</li>
<li>**Insight：**调用引起的缓存失效和上下文膨胀是重要的隐藏开销。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="car-bench-evaluating-the-consistency-and-limit-awareness-of-llm-agents-under-real-world-uncertainty"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.1886/">CAR-bench: Evaluating the Consistency and Limit-Awareness of LLM Agents under Real-World Uncertainty</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · Long · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**在车载助手工具环境中测试一致性、澄清和能力边界。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**理想任务完成率掩盖不确定输入下的冒进行动。</li>
<li>**Insight：**可靠性取决于持续正确以及知道何时补充信息或停止。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="current-agents-fail-to-leverage-world-model-as-tool-for-foresight"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.623/">Current Agents Fail to Leverage World Model as Tool for Foresight</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · Long · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**系统评测 Agent 将生成式世界模型当作预测工具的能力。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**拥有未来模拟器是否能改善决策尚未得到验证。</li>
<li>**Insight：**瓶颈在何时模拟及如何解释预测，而不只是模拟器是否可用。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="discovery-and-reinforcement-of-tool-integrated-reasoning-chains-via-rollout-trees"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.649/">Discovery and Reinforcement of Tool-Integrated Reasoning Chains via Rollout Trees</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · Long · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**用 rollout 树发现长思维链中的有效工具使用时机。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**缺少工具轨迹且直接加入工具可能损害原有长链推理。</li>
<li>**Insight：**可从工具介入前后的分支收益中学习调用价值。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="do-llms-know-tool-irrelevance-demystifying-structural-alignment-bias-in-tool-invocations"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.1473/">Do LLMs Know Tool Irrelevance? Demystifying Structural Alignment Bias in Tool Invocations</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · Long · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**用解耦语义相关性与参数可填充性的基准分析错误调用。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**模型会调用形式可匹配但语义无关的工具。</li>
<li>**Insight：**参数能填上不代表工具能实现用户意图。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="don-t-adapt-small-language-models-for-tools-adapt-tool-schemas-to-the-models"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.948/">Don’t Adapt Small Language Models for Tools; Adapt Tool Schemas to the Models</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · Long · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**按模型预训练熟悉度重命名工具 schema。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**小模型常因不熟悉命名约定而选错函数或参数。</li>
<li>**Insight：**调整工具接口也能提升调用能力，无需总是修改模型参数。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="empowering-multi-turn-tool-integrated-agentic-reasoning-with-group-turn-policy-optimization"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.1962/">Empowering Multi-Turn Tool-Integrated Agentic Reasoning with Group Turn Policy Optimization</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · Long · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**通过轮级奖励、折扣回报和代码自监督训练多轮工具推理。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**轨迹级 GRPO 奖励难区分各轮的贡献。</li>
<li>**Insight：**执行过程自带的信号可低成本缓解奖励稀疏。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="et-agent-incentivizing-effective-tool-integrated-reasoning-agent-via-behavior-calibration"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.333/">ET-Agent: Incentivizing Effective Tool-Integrated Reasoning Agent via Behavior Calibration</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · Long · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**通过数据自演化和分阶段行为校准训练工具推理。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**只奖励答案正确会保留冗余调用和调用不足。</li>
<li>**Insight：**工具行为需要独立于最终正确率接受显式优化。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="from-proof-to-program-characterizing-tool-induced-reasoning-hallucinations-in-large-language-models"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.1951/">From Proof to Program: Characterizing Tool-Induced Reasoning Hallucinations in Large Language Models</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · Long · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**用 PyMath 诊断代码工具引发的推理退化并进行偏好优化。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**工具执行正确和答案正确仍可能掩盖论证不成立。</li>
<li>**Insight：**工具输出应作为证据，不能替代逻辑论证。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="genesisfunc-multi-agent-data-generation-for-accurate-and-generalizable-function-calling"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.1319/">GenesisFunc: Multi-Agent Data Generation for Accurate and Generalizable Function-Calling</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · Long · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**以多 Agent 生成并多阶段校验函数调用对话。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**合成数据存在 API 不可靠、覆盖窄和质量不稳的问题。</li>
<li>**Insight：**可靠工具种子与分层质量控制能同时提升数据多样性和泛化。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="learning-from-the-irrecoverable-error-localized-policy-optimization-for-tool-integrated-llm-reasoning"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.504/">Learning from the Irrecoverable: Error-Localized Policy Optimization for Tool-Integrated LLM Reasoning</a></h4>
