<li>**Insight：**首次不可逆错误比均匀惩罚整条轨迹更适合作为归因锚点。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="looptool-closing-the-data-training-loop-for-robust-llm-tool-calls"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.968/">LoopTool: Closing the Data–Training Loop for Robust LLM Tool Calls</a></h4>
