<li>**Research Problem：**静态数据无法追踪模型当前失败模式。</li>
<li>**Insight：**数据生成与训练闭环比一次性扩大数据更能对准能力缺口。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="lost-in-execution-on-the-multilingual-robustness-of-tool-calling-in-large-language-models"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.2039/">Lost in Execution: On the Multilingual Robustness of Tool Calling in Large Language Models</a></h4>
