<li>**Research Problem：**英语工具调用表现无法代表跨语言执行可靠性。</li>
<li>**Insight：**理解用户意图正确仍可能因参数执行约定不匹配而失败。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="mcp-flow-facilitating-llm-agents-to-master-real-world-diverse-and-scaling-mcp-tools"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.231/">MCP-Flow: Facilitating LLM Agents to Master Real-World, Diverse and Scaling MCP Tools</a></h4>
