<li>**Insight：**服务发现、数据合成与训练可以形成可扩展的统一流水线。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="octotools-a-multi-agent-framework-with-extensible-tools-for-complex-reasoning"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.1/">OctoTools: A Multi-Agent Framework with Extensible Tools for Complex Reasoning</a></h4>
