</ul>
<h4 id="optico-adaptive-distributed-training-optimization-via-collaborative-agent-reasoning"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.1283/">OptiCo: Adaptive Distributed Training Optimization via Collaborative Agent Reasoning</a></h4>
