</ul>
<h4 id="r2if-aligning-reasoning-with-decisions-via-composite-rewards-for-interpretable-llm-function-calling"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.1715/">R2IF: Aligning Reasoning with Decisions via Composite Rewards for Interpretable LLM Function Calling</a></h4>
