<h4 id="reviewgrounder-improving-review-substantiveness-with-rubric-guided-tool-integrated-agents"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.1477/">ReviewGrounder: Improving Review Substantiveness with Rubric-Guided, Tool-Integrated Agents</a></h4>
