</ul>
<h4 id="rimrule-improving-tool-using-language-agents-via-mdl-guided-rule-learning"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.1599/">RIMRULE: Improving Tool-Using Language Agents via MDL-Guided Rule Learning</a></h4>
