<h4 id="hierarchical-reinforcement-learning-with-augmented-step-level-transitions-for-llm-agents"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.318/">Hierarchical Reinforcement Learning with Augmented Step-Level Transitions for LLM Agents</a></h4>
