<li>**Insight：**可控模拟世界能为小模型提供更丰富的行动和澄清训练。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="neoamt-neologism-aware-agentic-machine-translation-with-reinforcement-learning"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.345/">NeoAMT: Neologism-Aware Agentic Machine Translation with Reinforcement Learning</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · Long · 扩展相关</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**训练会调用词典检索工具的新词翻译 Agent。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**模型参数知识难覆盖不断变化的新词。</li>
<li>**Insight：**翻译策略可以主动查证，而不必凭旧知识猜译。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="recreate-reasoning-and-creating-domain-agents-driven-by-experience"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.1432/">ReCreate: Reasoning and Creating Domain Agents Driven by Experience</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · Long · 扩展相关</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**从执行经验诊断成功失败并编辑领域 Agent 框架。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**自动 Agent 设计只看最终分数而缺少原因分析。</li>
<li>**Insight：**运行轨迹可提供可复用的架构修改依据。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="reinforcement-learning-for-self-improving-agent-with-skill-library"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.69/">Reinforcement Learning for Self-Improving Agent with Skill Library</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · Long · 扩展相关</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**沿相似任务链训练技能生成、存储和复用。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**提示式技能库难稳定产生持续改进。</li>
<li>**Insight：**技能价值应由后续任务收益共同决定。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="stapo-selective-trajectory-aware-policy-optimization-for-llm-agent-training"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.1308/">STAPO: Selective Trajectory-Aware Policy Optimization for LLM Agent Training</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · Long · 扩展相关</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**用归一化熵定位忽视目标和历史的异常步骤并定向优化。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**普通熵混淆状态复杂度与决策不可靠性。</li>
<li>**Insight：**相对置信偏离能更准确识别轨迹注意力失效。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="taming-actor-observer-asymmetry-in-agents-via-dialectical-alignment"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.1104/">Taming Actor-Observer Asymmetry in Agents via Dialectical Alignment</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · Long · 扩展相关</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**以正反观点综合和强化学习减少执行者—观察者归因偏差。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**同一错误会因角色不同被归为外因或内因。</li>
<li>**Insight：**可靠纠错需要对角色视角保持一致的失败判断。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="timely-machine-awareness-of-time-makes-test-time-scaling-agentic"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.211/">Timely Machine: Awareness of Time Makes Test-Time Scaling Agentic</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · Long · 扩展相关</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**以真实墙钟时间为预算训练时间感知推理策略。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**token 数无法衡量含工具延迟的推理成本。</li>
<li>**Insight：**工具响应速度会改变最优模型规模和交互策略。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="towards-robust-real-world-spreadsheet-understanding-with-multi-agent-multi-format-reasoning"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.86/">Towards Robust Real-World Spreadsheet Understanding with Multi-Agent Multi-Format Reasoning</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · Long · 扩展相关</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**分区域读取代码、图像和表格表示并验证电子表格结构。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**纯文本及整表输入无法处理大规模复杂布局。</li>
<li>**Insight：**结构草图与有针对性的检查能支撑可靠表格工具推理。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="value-of-information-a-framework-for-human-agent-communication"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.1987/">Value of Information: A Framework for Human–Agent Communication</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · Long · 扩展相关</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**按信息价值比较提问收益与用户认知成本。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**Agent 难决定信息不全时行动还是澄清。</li>
<li>**Insight：**澄清策略应考虑决策风险，而非固定置信阈值。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="when-agents-look-the-same-quantifying-distillation-induced-similarity-in-tool-use-behaviors"><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.478/">When Agents Look the Same: Quantifying Distillation-Induced Similarity in Tool-Use Behaviors</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · Long · 扩展相关</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**用语言模式和动作图相似度测量蒸馏后的行为趋同。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**现有指标无法区分任务必要动作与教师特有习惯。</li>
<li>**Insight：**非必要的工具选择和依赖模式能揭示行为层面的蒸馏痕迹。</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="02-多模态感知与创作">02 · 多模态感知与创作</h2>
<p>81 篇 · CVPR 59 · ACL 22</p>
<h4 id="aeroagent-a-vision-physics-decision-framework-for-aerodynamic-vehicle-design"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Liu_AeroAgent_A_Vision-Physics-Decision_Framework_for_Aerodynamic_Vehicle_Design_CVPR_2026_paper.html">AeroAgent: A Vision-Physics-Decision Framework for Aerodynamic Vehicle Design</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · Main · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**在预算约束下联动形状生成、物理代理和高精度 CFD 验证。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**美观车辆生成未解决昂贵的物理设计迭代。</li>
<li>**Insight：**低成本代理筛选与少量高保真验证可构成有效设计闭环。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="agentic-retoucher-for-text-to-image-generation"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Shen_Agentic_Retoucher_for_Text-To-Image_Generation_CVPR_2026_paper.html">Agentic Retoucher for Text-To-Image Generation</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · Main · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**用感知、诊断和执行 Agent 定位并局部修复生成图像缺陷。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**整体重生成昂贵且局部编辑容易产生语义漂移。</li>
<li>**Insight：**把缺陷定位与编辑决策分离可提高修复精度。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="arm-thinker-reinforcing-multimodal-generative-reward-models-with-agentic-tool-use-and-visual-reasoning"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Ding_ARM-Thinker_Reinforcing_Multimodal_Generative_Reward_Models_with_Agentic_Tool_Use_CVPR_2026_paper.html">ARM-Thinker: Reinforcing Multimodal Generative Reward Models with Agentic Tool Use and Visual Reasoning</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · Main · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**训练能调用裁剪、文档检索等工具的多模态奖励模型。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**静态评分无法验证细节和跨页证据。</li>
<li>**Insight：**奖励模型也需要主动取证，而非仅凭已有上下文判断。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="beyond-sequential-tools-a-unified-vlm-agent-system-for-photographic-post-processing-via-dynamic-multi-expert-fusion"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Xiong_Beyond_Sequential_Tools_A_Unified_VLM_Agent_System_for_Photographic_CVPR_2026_paper.html">Beyond Sequential Tools: A Unified VLM Agent System for Photographic Post-Processing via Dynamic Multi-Expert Fusion</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · Main · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**由 VLM 动态分配多个专家 LoRA 权重并一次融合执行。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**顺序调用多个修图工具低效且存在退化耦合。</li>
<li>**Insight：**专业能力可在模型层组合，减少串行工具链开销。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="diffgraph-an-automated-agent-driven-model-merging-framework-for-in-the-wild-text-to-image-generation"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Li_DiffGraph_An_Automated_Agent-driven_Model_Merging_Framework_for_In-the-Wild_Text-to-Image_CVPR_2026_paper.html">DiffGraph: An Automated Agent-driven Model Merging Framework for In-the-Wild Text-to-Image Generation</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · Main · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**以图结构组织在线扩散专家并按需求选择子图合并。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**固定模型融合难利用不断增长的专家资源。</li>
<li>**Insight：**工具能力的可组合结构有助于匹配多样生成需求。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="don-t-show-pixels-show-cues-unlocking-visual-tool-reasoning-in-language-models-via-perception-programs"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Janjua_Dont_Show_Pixels_Show_Cues_Unlocking_Visual_Tool_Reasoning_in_CVPR_2026_paper.html">Don't Show Pixels, Show Cues: Unlocking Visual Tool Reasoning in Language Models via Perception Programs</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · Main · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**将深度、光流等工具输出转换为结构化语言线索。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**密集像素结果不适合语言模型直接推理。</li>
<li>**Insight：**工具收益取决于输出表示是否契合推理器。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="evograph-r1-self-evolving-multimodal-knowledge-hypergraphs-for-agentic-retrieval"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Lin_EvoGraph-R1_Self-Evolving_Multimodal_Knowledge_Hypergraphs_for_Agentic_Retrieval_CVPR_2026_paper.html">EvoGraph-R1: Self-Evolving Multimodal Knowledge Hypergraphs for Agentic Retrieval</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · Main · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**把知识超图作为可检索、扩展和编辑的交互环境。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**静态图与单次检索无法适应迭代推理。</li>
<li>**Insight：**Agent 获取证据时也应修正承载知识的结构。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="fusionagent-a-multimodal-agent-with-dynamic-model-selection-for-human-recognition"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Zhu_FusionAgent_A_Multimodal_Agent_with_Dynamic_Model_Selection_for_Human_CVPR_2026_paper.html">FusionAgent: A Multimodal Agent with Dynamic Model Selection for Human Recognition</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · Main · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**将人脸、步态等专家模型作为工具按样本动态选择。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**静态融合对每个输入都调用全部模型。</li>
<li>**Insight：**模型互补性应结合样本质量和模态可信度决定。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="geometrically-constrained-agent-for-spatial-reasoning"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Chen_Geometrically-Constrained_Agent_for_Spatial_Reasoning_CVPR_2026_paper.html">Geometrically-Constrained Agent for Spatial Reasoning</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · Main · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**先把空间问题转成形式化几何约束，再在约束内调用工具。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**精确计算工具无法修复本身错误的几何计划。</li>
<li>**Insight：**约束必须进入规划阶段，而不能只作用于最终计算。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="geommbench-and-geommagent-toward-expert-level-multimodal-intelligence-in-geoscience-and-remote-sensing"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Xiao_GeoMMBench_and_GeoMMAgent_Toward_Expert-Level_Multimodal_Intelligence_in_Geoscience_and_CVPR_2026_paper.html">GeoMMBench and GeoMMAgent: Toward Expert-Level Multimodal Intelligence in Geoscience and Remote Sensing</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · Main · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**用遥感专业模型与检索工具构建多 Agent 地学系统。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**通用模型缺乏多传感器理解和领域知识。</li>
<li>**Insight：**检索、感知与推理的专业分工能弥补单模型短板。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="graph-to-frame-rag-visual-space-knowledge-fusion-for-training-free-and-auditable-video-reasoning"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Yang_Graph-to-Frame_RAG_Visual-Space_Knowledge_Fusion_for_Training-Free_and_Auditable_Video_CVPR_2026_paper.html">Graph-to-Frame RAG: Visual-Space Knowledge Fusion for Training-Free and Auditable Video Reasoning</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · Main · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**检索最小知识子图并将其渲染为视觉推理帧。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**文本外部知识与视频证据混合会稀释注意力。</li>
<li>**Insight：**知识交付形式影响检索证据能否被视觉模型有效使用。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="hybrid-agents-for-image-restoration"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Li_Hybrid_Agents_for_Image_Restoration_CVPR_2026_paper.html">Hybrid Agents for Image Restoration</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · Main · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**按需求在快、慢和反馈修复 Agent 间调度专业工具。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**用户指令复杂度不同且串行修复会传播错误。</li>
<li>**Insight：**混合恢复模式与自适应推理开销应共同设计。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="ibisagent-reinforcing-pixel-level-visual-reasoning-in-mllms-for-universal-biomedical-object-referring-and-segmentation"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Jiang_IBISAgent_Reinforcing_Pixel-Level_Visual_Reasoning_in_MLLMs_for_Universal_Biomedical_CVPR_2026_paper.html">IBISAgent: Reinforcing Pixel-Level Visual Reasoning in MLLMs for Universal Biomedical Object Referring and Segmentation</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · Main · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**通过点击动作调用分割工具，并用强化学习迭代修正掩码。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**单次医疗分割缺少反馈且联合微调代价高。</li>
<li>**Insight：**把分割看作多步交互可复用现有工具并逐步提高精度。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="jarvisevo-towards-a-self-evolving-photo-editing-agent-with-synergistic-editor-evaluator-optimization"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Lin_JarvisEvo_Towards_a_Self-Evolving_Photo_Editing_Agent_with_Synergistic_Editor-Evaluator_CVPR_2026_paper.html">JarvisEvo: Towards a Self-Evolving Photo Editing Agent with Synergistic Editor-Evaluator Optimization</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · Main · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**联合优化编辑器与评估器，循环调用保真和生成式编辑工具。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**静态奖励可被利用，文本思维链也会误解视觉指令。</li>
<li>**Insight：**编辑与评估共同演化能改善反馈质量和工具决策。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="learning-to-focus-and-precise-cropping-a-reinforcement-learning-framework-with-information-gaps-and-grounding-loss-for-mllms"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Zhao_Learning_to_Focus_and_Precise_CroppingA_Reinforcement_Learning_Framework_with_CVPR_2026_paper.html">Learning to Focus and Precise Cropping:A Reinforcement Learning Framework with Information Gaps and Grounding Loss for MLLMs</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · Main · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**先制造全局信息缺口，再训练精确局部裁剪。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**模型可能调用裁剪工具却仍依赖全局图像猜答案。</li>
<li>**Insight：**必须让裁剪真正提供不可替代的信息才能学会依赖工具。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="learning-to-select-visual-tools-from-experience"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Huang_Learning_to_Select_Visual_Tools_from_Experience_CVPR_2026_paper.html">Learning to Select Visual Tools from Experience</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · Main · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**通过结果奖励学习从多样视觉工具库中选择和组合工具。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**提示与模仿学习缺少主动工具探索。</li>
<li>**Insight：**最终任务反馈即可驱动发现可泛化的工具使用路径。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="lenswalk-agentic-video-understanding-by-planning-how-you-see-in-videos"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Li_LensWalk_Agentic_Video_Understanding_by_Planning_How_You_See_in_CVPR_2026_paper.html">LensWalk: Agentic Video Understanding by Planning How You See in Videos</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · Main · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**让推理器主动控制视频观察的时间范围和采样密度。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**静态视频预处理无法跟随推理需求变化。</li>
<li>**Insight：**控制如何观察比固定提供更多帧更有效。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="lighting-grounded-video-generation-with-renderer-based-agent-reasoning"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Cai_Lighting-grounded_Video_Generation_with_Renderer-based_Agent_Reasoning_CVPR_2026_paper.html">Lighting-grounded Video Generation with Renderer-based Agent Reasoning</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · Main · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**用场景 Agent 将指令转为渲染器可执行的布局、光照和相机控制。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**视频生成中的场景属性纠缠且难精确操作。</li>
<li>**Insight：**显式三维控制信号可连接高层语言与可控视频生成。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="longvt-incentivizing-thinking-with-long-videos-via-native-tool-calling"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Yang_LongVT_Incentivizing_Thinking_with_Long_Videos_via_Native_Tool_Calling_CVPR_2026_paper.html">LongVT: Incentivizing &quot;Thinking with Long Videos&quot; via Native Tool Calling</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · Main · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**把视频时间定位作为原生裁剪工具执行全局到局部推理。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**长视频证据稀疏且文本思维链容易幻觉。</li>
<li>**Insight：**反复回看关键片段能让推理持续依赖真实视觉证据。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="meta-meta-evolution-of-tool-trajectory-adaptation-for-long-video-understanding"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Huang_META_Meta_Evolution_of_Tool_Trajectory_Adaptation_for_Long-Video_Understanding_CVPR_2026_paper.html">META: Meta Evolution of Tool Trajectory Adaptation for Long-Video Understanding</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · Main · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**从工具轨迹提炼宏工具并从失败总结使用约束。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**静态视频 Agent 为每个任务重建重复微操作。</li>
<li>**Insight：**工具组合模式本身可以成为可演化、可复用的技能。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="octot2i-a-self-evolving-agentic-text-to-image-router"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Jiang_OctoT2I_A_Self-Evolving_Agentic_Text-to-Image_Router_CVPR_2026_paper.html">OctoT2I: A Self-Evolving Agentic Text-to-Image Router</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · Main · 直接工具使用</p>
<ul>
<li>**Idea：**通过自探索学习生成模型能力边界并动态路由图像工具。</li>
<li>**Research Problem：**人工工具先验和单一路由忽略效率与模型互补性。</li>
<li>**Insight：**工具能力知识可以由提出任务—执行—评价的闭环自动积累。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="oralgpt-plus-learning-to-use-visual-tools-via-reinforcement-learning-for-panoramic-x-ray-analysis"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Fan_OralGPT-Plus_Learning_to_Use_Visual_Tools_via_Reinforcement_Learning_for_CVPR_2026_paper.html">OralGPT-Plus: Learning to Use Visual Tools via Reinforcement Learning for Panoramic X-ray Analysis</a></h4>
