<li>**Research Problem：**静态单次读取不足以支撑细粒度诊断验证。</li>
<li>**Insight：**有临床意义的复查比无目标增加思考更有用。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="proof-of-perception-certified-tool-using-multimodal-reasoning-with-compositional-conformal-guarantees"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Fayyazi_Proof-of-Perception_Certified_Tool-Using_Multimodal_Reasoning_with_Compositional_Conformal_Guarantees_CVPR_2026_paper.html">Proof-of-Perception: Certified Tool-Using Multimodal Reasoning with Compositional Conformal Guarantees</a></h4>
