<h4 id="see-and-fix-the-flaws-enabling-vlms-and-diffusion-models-to-comprehend-visual-artifacts-via-agentic-data-synthesis"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Park_See_and_Fix_the_Flaws_Enabling_VLMs_and_Diffusion_Models_CVPR_2026_paper.html">See and Fix the Flaws: Enabling VLMs and Diffusion Models to Comprehend Visual Artifacts via Agentic Data Synthesis</a></h4>
