</ul>
<h4 id="worldmm-dynamic-multimodal-memory-agent-for-long-video-reasoning"><a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2026/html/Yeo_WorldMM_Dynamic_Multimodal_Memory_Agent_for_Long_Video_Reasoning_CVPR_2026_paper.html">WorldMM: Dynamic Multimodal Memory Agent for Long Video Reasoning</a></h4>
